  orange, 0.1->visible red. Magnitude honesty stays in alpha/size.
v9 (age lifecycle color + fast wave):
- deep check: 8 live frames audited, 566 unit values: med 0.997, p25 0.95 --
  value-normalized color could NOT produce gray births; gray came from wave
  timing perception + dark small dots. Fix: hue now purely age-driven
  (bright red -> yellow -> gray -> gone), strength only in size/glow.
- wave 45->20ms/step (full reveal ~1.6s)
v10 (contain-fit):
- cover-crop sliced data extremes on narrow canvas: dots off-screen, stray
